sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User (Pentester)
  participant FE as Frontend (SPA)
  participant API as Backend API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant FS as Workspace (temp)
  participant AG as Agent Loop
  participant LLM as LLM Provider
  participant TL as Tools SAST

  U->>FE: Pilih file source (.zip), provider/model, deskripsi
  FE->>API: POST /api/v1/static/scan (multipart: file .zip)
  API->>API: Cek file ada & .zip, validasi provider/model, cek scan berjalan
  alt Tidak valid / sudah ada scan berjalan
    API-->>FE: 400 / 409
    FE-->>U: Tampilkan error
  else Valid
    API->>FS: Simpan upload ke temp
    API->>DB: Simpan scan "running", buat scan_id
    API-->>FE: 202 Accepted {scan_id}
    Note over API,AG: Proses berjalan asinkron (background)

    par Proses background (Sistem)
      API->>FS: Ekstrak ZIP ke workspace (batasi jumlah file & ukuran)
      alt Arsip valid
        loop Triage (sampai final / max_steps)
          AG->>LLM: Minta aksi berikutnya
          LLM-->>AG: Pilih tool SAST
          AG->>TL: semgrep / gitleaks / osv / read_file / grep_code
          TL-->>AG: Temuan
        end
        AG->>AG: Susun temuan + rekomendasi remediasi
      else Arsip tidak valid
        AG->>AG: Tandai gagal (failed)
      end
      AG->>FS: Hapus temp & workspace
      AG->>DB: Simpan status terminal
      opt Status completed
        AG->>DB: Simpan laporan SAST otomatis
      end
    and Alur User (polling)
      loop Sampai status bukan "running"
        FE->>API: GET /api/v1/scans/{scan_id}
        API->>DB: Ambil status
        DB-->>API: Status
        API-->>FE: Status / progress
      end
    end

    FE-->>U: Tampilkan hasil scan + laporan
  end
